 226            /
 227            /       THE PROGRAM MAY BE STARTED OR RESTARTED AT ANYTIME AT 0200.
 228            /       THE DATA FILE ON PAGE ZERO IS CLEARED, ALL FLAGS INITIALIZED,
 229            /       AND THE SR EXAMINED.  IF THE SR=0 THE DISPLAY UPDATE ROUTINES
 230            /       ARE SET TO PICK UP THE STATUS WORD FROM THE SR.  IF THE SR
 231            /       DOES NOT EQUAL ZERO, THE STATUS WORD IS READ FROM THE EIGHT
 232            /       CONTINGENCY INPUTS ON THE BLUE RIBBON CONNECTOR OF THE AX08
 233            /       (XR OPTION ONLY).  JUMP IS THEN TO THE DISPLAY
 234            /       FILE UPDATE TO START OFF THE GAME.
 235            /
