2029            /
2030            /       POSCAL IS CALLED TO CALCULATE THE COORDINATE INCREMENTS
2031            /       NECESSARY TO PRODUCE THE SHIP FIGURES.  RATHER THAN DOING
2032            /       A LOT OF EXPENSIVE MATH THIS DOES A QUICK PRODUCTION
2033            /       OF 1, 2, AND 3 TIMES THE SIN AND COSINE VALUES FOUND
2034            /       IN CALSIN AND CALCOS LEAVING THEM IN THE TABLE FOR
2035            /       ONESET AND TWOSET.  IF THE SCOPE WERE ANY BETTER
2036            /       THIS PROBABLY WOULDN'T BE NEAR GOOD ENOUGH BUT....
2037            /
